      "contextAfter": "When you call the [`bestMoveForActivePlayer()`](gkstrategist/bestmoveforactiveplayer().md) method, the Monte Carlo strategist randomly chooses between the available moves for the current player (see the [`gameModelUpdates(for:)`](gkgamemodel/gamemodelupdates(for:).md) method of your game model class), then randomly chooses a subsequent move, and so on, until it reaches a state in which the game is either won or lost.",
